<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="400581350"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1700472867"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Afterlife (feat. Echos)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Echos"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Afterlife (feat Echos)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="06:04.091"><div begin="00:23.122" end="05:13.477"><p begin="00:23.122" end="00:32.559" itunes:key="L1">After we're gone, who will breathe the earth we lost?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们逝去，谁将在这片我们曾拥有的土地上呼吸？</span></p><p begin="00:33.349" end="00:37.751" itunes:key="L2">We leave nothing but our thoughts<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们留下的，唯有思绪</span></p><p begin="00:38.514" end="00:43.411" itunes:key="L3">And memories beneath the dust<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以及尘埃之下，那些记忆</span></p><p begin="00:43.808" end="00:48.352" itunes:key="L4">So when this body fails to mend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以当这躯体无力回天</span></p><p begin="00:49.408" end="00:54.350" itunes:key="L5">And all my demons, they come crashing in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我所有的心魔汹涌而至</span></p><p begin="00:55.220" end="01:05.205" itunes:key="L6">Will I start to begin or will I fade away with them?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是会重新开始，还是与它们一同消逝？</span></p><p begin="01:07.066" end="01:12.441" itunes:key="L7">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="01:12.846" end="01:17.951" itunes:key="L8">In the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="01:18.102" end="01:23.445" itunes:key="L9">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="01:23.735" end="01:29.193" itunes:key="L10">In the afterlife<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那来生</span></p><p begin="01:50.707" end="01:56.185" itunes:key="L11">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="01:56.479" end="02:01.448" itunes:key="L12">In the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="02:01.632" end="02:07.111" itunes:key="L13">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="02:07.330" end="02:12.742" itunes:key="L14">In the afterlife<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那来生</span></p><p begin="03:19.358" end="03:23.803" itunes:key="L15">So when this body fails to mend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以当这躯体无力回天</span></p><p begin="03:24.877" end="03:29.483" itunes:key="L16">And all the demons, they come crashing in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有心魔，汹涌而至</span></p><p begin="03:30.581" end="03:40.230" itunes:key="L17">Will we start to begin or will we fade away with them?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是选择开始新生，还是随他们一同消逝？</span></p><p begin="04:04.492" end="04:09.737" itunes:key="L18">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="04:10.133" end="04:15.141" itunes:key="L19">In the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="04:15.306" end="04:20.677" itunes:key="L20">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="04:20.893" end="04:26.897" itunes:key="L21">In the afterlife<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那来生</span></p><p begin="04:50.797" end="04:56.176" itunes:key="L22">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="04:56.385" end="05:01.501" itunes:key="L23">In the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="05:01.664" end="05:07.023" itunes:key="L24">And in the afterlife, tell me we'll be fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在来生，请告诉我我们终将安好</span></p><p begin="05:07.217" end="05:13.477" itunes:key="L25">And in the afterlife<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那来生</span></p></div></body></tt>